{"unit_id":"condaThinker__dsh-image-inline#card-zh","repo":"condaThinker/dsh-image-inline","commit":"ed05325ec890182107538c43f89d8813f51bc9c3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-inline 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的图片展示插件。它向模型提供 show_image 工具，读取工作区中的 PNG、JPEG、WebP 或 GIF 图片，将图片保存为 DSH 附件，并让浏览器在对应的工具调用位置显示图片卡片。对话结果保留路径和图片摘要，界面可显示缩略图并打开原图；嵌套调用或旧记录缺少展示元数据时，还可从结果中的路径加载图片。插件支持限制单张图片的字节数和像素数，并把附件引用注册表保存在 DSH_HOME 下。适合希望在网页对话中查看本地图片、截图或生成图像的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:229-271","dsh/index.js:275-357","dsh/client.js:194-265","cordis.patch.yml:9-22"]}
{"unit_id":"condaThinker__dsh-image-inline#card-en","repo":"condaThinker/dsh-image-inline","commit":"ed05325ec890182107538c43f89d8813f51bc9c3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-image-inline displays local PNG, JPEG, WebP, and GIF images in DSH web chat. The model calls show_image with a path; the plugin stores an attachment and the client shows a thumbnail with an original-image link. It also supports path-based rendering and configurable size limits.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:229-271","dsh/index.js:275-357","dsh/client.js:194-265","cordis.patch.yml:9-22"]}
