{"unit_id":"condaThinker__dsh-image-inline#feature-1","repo":"condaThinker/dsh-image-inline","commit":"ed05325ec890182107538c43f89d8813f51bc9c3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-inline 的功能「对话内显示图片」：模型调用 show_image 并提供图片路径后，插件保存附件并在网页对话对应位置渲染图片卡片；用户可查看缩略图并打开原图。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:229-233","dsh/client.js:221-237"]}
{"unit_id":"condaThinker__dsh-image-inline#feature-2","repo":"condaThinker/dsh-image-inline","commit":"ed05325ec890182107538c43f89d8813f51bc9c3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-inline 的功能「嵌套调用图片回退」：当工具结果没有附件展示元数据时，客户端从文本结果提取图片路径，通过路径路由显示图片；加载失败会回退到结果文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/client.js:239-266","dsh/index.js:472-485"]}
{"unit_id":"condaThinker__dsh-image-inline#feature-3","repo":"condaThinker/dsh-image-inline","commit":"ed05325ec890182107538c43f89d8813f51bc9c3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-inline 的功能「图片格式和大小限制」：工具根据文件扩展名接受 PNG、JPEG、WebP 或 GIF，并按配置限制图片字节数与像素数，超限时返回说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:139-144","dsh/index.js:281-327","cordis.patch.yml:9-22"]}
{"unit_id":"condaThinker__dsh-image-inline#feature-4","repo":"condaThinker/dsh-image-inline","commit":"ed05325ec890182107538c43f89d8813f51bc9c3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-inline 的功能「保留图片历史展示」：插件把附件的媒体类型、大小和尺寸记录到本机注册表，网页端据此读取图片，使已有对话中的图片卡片在主机重启后仍能加载。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:329-341","dsh/index.js:409-469"]}
